	&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.dapenti.com:99/dapenti/ef65f0c012/e149ea83.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; 
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	【20】拜登发表公开演讲大骂川普贪污腐败
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.dapenti.com:99/dapenti/dd99139526/ebe4364c.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt; 
